@startuml 01j-sequence-ansible-convergence
!include ../_style.iuml
title Pi-Gen imaging: post-boot Ansible convergence on the head (dalmasca)

participant "systemd" as SD
participant "ivalice-postboot-ansible\n.service" as SVC
participant "ivalice-wait-for-\nworkers.sh" as W
participant "run-ansible.sh\nansible-playbook site.yml" as A
participant "dalmasca\n(local connection)" as H
participant "workers x5\n(ssh ivalice@10.42.0.11-15,\nkey /root/.ssh/ivalice-cluster)" as WK
database "/var/log/ivalice/\nansible.log" as LOG

SD -> SVC : start (After slurmctld, network-online,\nRequires slurmctld,\nif role.head and not ansible-postboot.done)
SVC -> W : ExecStartPre
loop every 10 s, up to 600 s
  W -> WK : ping -c1 each worker IP
end
alt >= 3 of 5 respond
  W --> SVC : exit 0
else timeout
  W --> SVC : exit 1 -> Restart after 120 s
end
SVC -> A : ExecStart (stdout/stderr -> ansible.log)
A -> LOG : log_path
group 10-common.yml (all 6 nodes)
  A -> H : facts, k3s_enabled from k3s.enabled marker
  A -> WK : same, in parallel (forks=6)
  note right
    asserts: node.conf has NODE_ROLE, hostname -s = inventory name,
    firstboot.done, /etc/hosts has 6 entries, podman present,
    munge active + key 0400 munge:munge, slurm.conf present,
    clock drift < 300 s. sysctl bridge-nf-call-iptables + ip_forward.
  end note
end
group 20-slurm-controller.yml (head, any_errors_fatal)
  A -> H : start slurmctld, wait :6817, scontrol ping,\nsinfo lists >= 5 nodes
end
group 30-slurm-compute.yml (workers, serial 2)
  A -> WK : start slurmd, wait :6818
  A -> H : delegate: sinfo -n <worker> until idle/mix/alloc (soft)
end
group 40 / 50 k3s (only where k3s_enabled)
  A -> H : start k3s, wait :6443, /healthz ok,\ncopy node-token
  A -> WK : write config.yaml, start k3s-agent,\nkubectl wait Ready (delegated)
end
group 90-verify.yml (head)
  A -> H : sinfo: >= 5 nodes idle/mix/alloc
  A -> WK : srun -N5 ~--ntasks-per-node=1 hostname (as ivalice)
  A -> H : assert 5 hostnames, k3s nodes Ready (if enabled)
  A -> H : write ansible-postboot.done
end
A --> SVC : rc
SVC -> SVC : ExecStartPost writes ansible-postboot.done again

note over A, WK #FFE4E1
  FINDING (likely blockers, verify on the head):
  1. Workers are reached as ivalice with become=sudo and become_ask_pass=False,
     but config.base does not set PASSWORDLESS_SUDO=1 (pi-gen default 0), so
     every privileged task on a worker should fail on the sudo password prompt.
  2. ansible.cfg sets stdout_callback = yaml, which lives in community.general,
     and common/tasks uses ansible.posix.sysctl. Debian ansible-core ships neither
     collection, and an unresolvable module fails at parse time, which
     ignore_errors cannot catch.
  3. StartLimitIntervalSec is in [Service], see 01h.
end note

note over W, WK #FFE4E1
  FINDING: the wait quorum is 3 of 5, but 90-verify hard-requires all 5 workers
  idle/mix/alloc and srun -N5 to succeed (20-slurm-controller only counts
  configured nodes, which sinfo lists even when down). With 1-2 workers down the
  service burns its 5 restarts in 30 min and stops. Align quorum and verify bar.
end note
@enduml
